---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="页面未找到">
  <section class="not-found container">
    <span class="eyebrow">404 / Token not found</span>
    <h1>这个 Token，<br /><span>还没有生成。</span></h1>
    <p>你访问的页面不存在，或者已经移动。回到首页，继续下一个可能。</p>
    <a class="button button-dark" href={base}>返回首页 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .not-found {
    min-height: 65vh;
    padding-top: 96px;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.07em;
    line-height: 1.04;
  }

  h1 span {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .not-found > p {
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    color: var(--dim);
  }
</style>
